    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_053"
    },
    {
        "text": "!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heavy-weapons throwers, careful!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "Giant, floating weapons...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "Was that you, Feline? You did that? You're\u2014a Caster?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "Put your weapons down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's okay now. Go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Go... go where? We've already... my teammates, my old friends, they all... they all...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "Qing, help him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Got it. Come here, brother. Those Sarkaz just don't see.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Qing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll say it again, Sarkaz. Put your weapons down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_053"
    },
    {
        "text": "You think we'll stop resisting just because you're holding a weapon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "We don't think that way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then you want to be killed?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_053"
    },
    {
        "text": "We don't have much of a choice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "Attacking your own comrades, hurting your own kin\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_053"
    },
    {
        "text": "When were the Infected ever our kin? Our kin only numbers Sarkaz.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "You couldn't have said that when you joined Reunion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "text": "Betraying, harming your family, playing other people's feelings...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "text": "Disgusting.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
