    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rosmontis, stop...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, Amiya.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Raidian just sent it out\u2014the last message Dr. Kal'tsit gave us was that we should take care around the special Infected...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're likely a variant of the special Infected from Lungmen, and we don't know if they'll infect others in progression!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sarkaz warriors, listen to me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "There are some... Sarkaz with a deep infection, and they're catalyzing the other Infected!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "We need the other Infected to withdraw from their current areas... Your block still has Infected survivors apart from you, and they're all non-combatants!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if we won't pass through here, I still hope we can all lend a hand to ensuring the safety of those Infected!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That's impossible. They wouldn't do that. They have no conscience.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_053"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "We... we've seen it. We went out on our own.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "We can't pull back. If they come this way... we'll have to get rid of them. We can't let even more Sarkaz get infected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "You might get infected yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_053"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who gives a damn.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "You want to end up like them too? Those monsters controlled by Arts? You don't give a damn if you do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_053"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not the first time we've been made out to be monsters, is it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Oh, um... ah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_053"
    },
    {
        "text": "This city's toast. Sooner or later, sure, we might end up like them. But if we can exterminate them, then everything gets a little easier. Some people can still live on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "As long as Talulah isn't dead, this city will be annihilated.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_053"
    },
    {
        "text": "If W can't kill her, there's no chance you can.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you don't stand with the winner, you can't win; in war, if you can't win, you die.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "But if you keep hurting any more Infected, then this might be where you die.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_053"
    },
    {
        "text": "And what if I die, then? What if I turn into one of Mephisto's Herd, huh...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mephisto's a monster, too. We kill other Infected because we're all monsters.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "All we want is for the Sarkaz not to suffer any further, but when you think about it, what if we suffer?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "When you leave here and go whatever, will they look you in the eye?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you not know your end, being an Infected?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course you know. The moment you leave that tiny little squad of yours, you'll die.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "You'll be despised, wrung by the neck, lashed, whipped, and hung.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or you'll be driven out of the cities, run vagrant, and you'll starve, bitten to death by the beasts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can't live on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "And you have no dignity.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "...What do you know?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Warrior...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tell me. That you're not fighting for Talulah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_053"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's... strong. With her, the chance that more people live on is better.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "We don't care if we kill a few more for it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
