    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "Get lost. Next time, I'll cut you in half.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_053"
    },
    {
        "text": "Feline. If you want to pass through here, then just kill us...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "We sure don't want to see our own end up that way. That's if you can kill us, though. Hahah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "You really are the most unsalvageable people.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$smallearthquake",
        "volume": 0.9
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 40,
        "randomness": 60,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_053"
    },
    {
        "text": "What...? What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "What was... that sound?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, no...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "The block we're in is nearing the ones the command tower closes off its entrances with... Reunion is likely trying to raise the entire sealing layer to cover any way in!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're almost out of time!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sarkaz. I'll give you one last chance. If you don't want to get mangled, pull out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_053"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Heh. Hahah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll settle this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_053"
    },
    {
        "text": "Cautus. Hah. What do you think you can do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "text": "Black lines...? That's\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_chercen_2",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Pant*... *pant*. Ugh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's the... state of things?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've suppressed all consciousless Sarkaz mercenaries.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis Squadmember"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "O\u2014okay, that's good, ngh... Are there other Infected.. here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "We have news, but I can't say whether it's good or bad. Recon operators looked around a little. There are, all over this block. And most of them... are in terrible shape. They must've been passive Infected, imprisoned in concentration.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis Squadmember"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Any passage through the... sealing... layer?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, this part leads to an engineering passage. Should be able to directly enter the structural control area, hack their remote panels. They can't do a thing about that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis Squadmember"
    },
    {
        "text": "Otherwise, for the open passages, recon ops have sighted at least four battlegrounds, all of them guerrillas against other Reunion...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis Squadmember"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "The combat situation seems intense...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "The guerrillas are strong, but the Talulah-aligned Reunion have the terrain advantage, and Sarkaz mercenaries backing them. They won't be able to push through for a while.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis Squadmember"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's okay, Amiya. Captain, us engineers will sneak our way in. We'll cut the energy supply to the whole sealing layer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis Squadmember"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "Can you do it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Definitely.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis Squadmember"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's too risky.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Entering the core city was risky in the first place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis Squadmember"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "No objections, then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're going.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis Squadmember"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "The, um... the, um!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "text": "Take care. Mm-hm... take care.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're not elite operator Rosmontis's squad for nothing. Don't you worry about a thing!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis Squadmember"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Put your own safety first.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you wanted us to listen, you wouldn't have used those Arts just now!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis Squadmember"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Engineering group, move out! Hustle your bustles!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis Squadmember"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "...They're gone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh. Amiya. You shouldn't use up your strength here. Let me handle all that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...This way, you'll be able to do less harm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "Does Rhodes Island not want me to do things this way?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's not it. It's just... if we could, we obviously don't want things done this way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "And the only thing I've used up is strength. What you use up is... your awareness.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't really care.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But... we should care.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya! This fellow wants a few words with you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Qing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "...You're from Reunion, Infected friend. Can I call you that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Whatever. Just... whatever. We're all... done for. I wanted to ask where you're gonna go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "And if... we can go with you, maybe. We've got nowhere to really go. The Sarkaz'll kill us, and we don't want to fight our own people anymore. The guerrillas'll kill us for sure, too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Why do you feel that way?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "They'd kill anyone if they wanted, wouldn't they? I've heard there's times they say they'll kill the Infected, just because someone did something or other wrong!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...I'm not sure. They might do that, but they might not.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "My belief is, you have to see how they truly are to reach the facts. You can't just go on hearsay.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "But we won't force you off to where they are. You're afraid of them, and the things they're doing don't sit well with you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And that's why I wanted to... to ask where you're all going.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014We're heading for the core command tower.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Are you insane?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "We want to put a stop to this turmoil, so we have to head for the command tower.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Can I ask you for a favor, Infected friend?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "If it's killing\u2014then\u2014then no.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not. I'm hoping you can all... safeguard the bystander Infected on this block.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Be careful. They might not like you... they might not like your uniforms.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Then what do we do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think you have two options. One is, take off that uniform, and be Reunion no longer...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "And the other is, wear your uniforms, but do what you should do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "One option is easy, and one's very hard, but I believe... this is something you should choose for yourselves.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
