    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$nervous_intro",
        "key": "$nervous_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "Command tower entrance"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_058"
    },
    {
        "text": "Curs! The cowards! They're blocking off the tower entrances with the sealing layers!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard"
    },
    {
        "text": "Have we still not breached them?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Sarkaz mercenaries are entrenching every sealing sector's in-roads! Other Infected have constantly been harassing us! We can't concentrate our attention!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_058"
    },
    {
        "text": "You, repeat. You're asking us and Rhodes Island to cooperate?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_059"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?"
    },
    {
        "text": "If Rhodes Island is unworthy of your trust, then you don't need to think about any of this city's people for a second more.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if the rules are going out of style, they'll still play by them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_058",
        "name2": "avg_npc_059",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if they still owe the Captain their lives?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_058",
        "name2": "avg_npc_059",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "If we all die here, who'll carry on Patriot's spirit?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?"
    },
    {
        "text": "We have strength, and Rhodes Island has knowledge. At the last, Kal'tsit's incredible on both counts. I personally think she's on par with the Captain. And you saw, even the Captain gave her his recognition!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?"
    },
    {
        "text": "The sealing layer's still rising! You'd better decide, because we don't have much time left!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_perimeter",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_059"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's more or less the shape of things. I've already told them about things, so, Amiya...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not asking you to agree to this. I'm just thinking it might be good for us, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?"
    },
    {
        "text": "It'll lead to a little less wounded all around...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I'm not really on top of things. I just...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's alright, Guard. Your proposal is reasonable. It's just that we... we won't do things the same way the Shieldguards do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "We don't have any right to exercise over the Infected, and we won't adopt their... disciplinary methods.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are they almost here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_059"
    },
    {
        "text": "Should be.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Amiya, I'm making less and less sense of anything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_topout",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042",
        "name2": "avg_npc_058",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Feline. I'm looking for your leader.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042",
        "name2": "avg_npc_058",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If you want revenge, is now a good time?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042",
        "name2": "avg_npc_058",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't think you can try pissing me off just because you know a bit of Arts, white cat!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042",
        "name2": "avg_npc_058",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't like you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042",
        "name2": "avg_npc_058",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Am I making you realize? The way you do things, you're no merchant's underling, eh? You're more like some Infected warrior hero, aren't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you talking about?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Guerrilla fighter.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can't threaten our employees. You don't have the authority.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_058"
    },
    {
        "text": "...The Lord.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard"
    },
    {
        "text": "Can you command those Sarkaz?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_058",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...I can't, and I couldn't. Please don't call me that. All I am is a member of Rhodes Island. Nothing to do with race, nor any arbitrary form of power.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_058",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Then that makes things simple, if you and them have absolutely no blood affinity.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're going to team up with us here? Wreck the command tower together?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_058",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_058"
    },
    {
        "text": "What're you so on guard for? We're obviously the ones yielding here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard"
    },
    {
        "text": "The other guerrillas still don't know what I'm up to, but I have faith you feel the same way as them. This city's people are enslaved by Talulah and her wicked plans, and you too want to liberate them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard"
    },
    {
        "text": "We want to revive hope for the Infected, so let's light one more flame for this city!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard"
    },
    {
        "text": "if you truly fight for the Infected, then you're sure to agree.",
